      "writtenOn": "2024-07-18T15:20:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So I think properties like this get populated based on Phenotype flags Google sets... while this is configurable, I\u0027m not sure how easy it is for OEMs to override it, as compared to SystemConfig backed by XML that OEMs can customize... perhaps we should move this to there?",
      "revId": "1f973213b02ac1369d691f927a1b00d3eec038b2",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
